$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=psicharcl  LOC_AFTER=?

* Closure: the character-twisted psi is a complex number.

s1::psicharval |- ( ( Q e. NN /\ X e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` Q ) ) /\ Y e. RR ) -> ( X ( psiChar ` Q ) Y ) = sum_ n e. ( 1 ... ( |_ ` Y ) ) ( ( X ` ( ( ZRHom ` ( Z/nZ ` Q ) ) ` n ) ) x. ( Lam ` n ) ) )
